WEBVTT

00:00:00.733 --> 00:00:05.000
Your AI agent just quoted the wrong enterprise price.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
One document says $95,000. The approved final says $120,000 per year,
plus $25,000 for implementation.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Find Anything searches permission-scoped knowledge and detects the conflict.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Both documents return with exact citations.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Pricing Final ranks highest because it is newer, approved, and authoritative.
The conflicting draft remains visible.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
An unavailable Finance record is excluded without revealing its contents.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Know what was searched, what was trusted, and what could not be accessed.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
See what changed, what to trust, and what could not be accessed.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Find Anything. AI agents that know what to trust.
